`frontend/hermes-web/public/plugins/fleet.json`
(sha256 `1d92e5557a8ed3dd3e1e8be594a103eb3f7c504571346579831944727642ba02`)
is a Qubit-authored manifest aggregate mirroring the two pinned dashboard
manifests (tab paths/positions, entry, css) with a Qubit-neutral description.
It is verified against the pinned manifests by
`tests/test_dashboard_plugin_fleet.py::test_static_fleet_manifest_mirrors_pinned_plugins`.

